          <note>Following Raghavan, it is assumed here that it is the Vijayarāghava Dīkṣita who was the guru of Bhāskara Dīkṣita; both hailed from the same place. See: Raghavan, Venkataraman. Śāhendravilāsa of Śrīdhara Veṅkaṭeśa (A Poem on the Life of King Śāhaji of Tanjore, 1684-1710). Tiruchi: The Kalyan Press, 1952, p. 40.</note>
